        &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.devkuma.com/docs/bootstrap/bootstrap.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Bootstrap&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bootstrap is a front-end framework for developing dynamic websites and web applications. It provides design templates based on HTML and CSS for input fields, buttons, navigation, other components, and various layouts, and it also includes additional JavaScript extensions.&lt;/p&gt;

